{"id":"9329f75331cb2511","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-lem-generic-exists-countable.md","title":"Generic Filter Exists","display":"lem-generic-exists-countable — Generic Filter Exists","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-generic-exists-countable","aliases":["58-lem-generic-exists-countable","Rasiowa-Sikorski Lemma","Generic Filter Existence"],"display":"lem-generic-exists-countable — Generic Filter Exists","depends_on":["[[58-df-ctm]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","[[../batch07/58-thm-rasiowa-sikorski.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-generic-exists-countable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-generic-exists-countable</span><span>Rasiowa-Sikorski Lemma</span><span>Generic Filter Existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-generic-exists-countable — Generic Filter Exists"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"746b177ad471e105\" href=\"?note=746b177ad471e105\" title=\"../batch07/58-thm-rasiowa-sikorski.md\">../batch07/58-thm-rasiowa-sikorski.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (可数传递模型, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P\\in M\">\\(P,\\leq_P\\in M\\)</span> (偏序及其次序, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (偏序谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\)</span> (足够 ZFC 片段的可数传递模型)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (generic filter over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}generic\\text{-}exists\\text{-}countable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\to\\exists G\\subseteq P\\;\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}generic\\text{-}exists\\text{-}countable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\to\\exists G\\subseteq P\\;\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the usual countable-model form of the Rasiowa-Sikorski lemma.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> is nontrivial, an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-generic filter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> is not an element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>这里与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a> 的二元谓词签名、以及 generic filter 的四元签名一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-thm-rasiowa-sikorski.md","status":"resolved","id":"746b177ad471e105","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-rasiowa-sikorski.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M$ (可数传递模型, see [[58-df-ctm]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,\\leq_P\\in M$ (偏序及其次序, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)$ (generic filter over $M$, see [[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这里与 [[58-df-ctm]] 的二元谓词签名、以及 generic filter 的四元签名一致。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"P,\\leq_P\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}generic\\text{-}exists\\text{-}countable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\to\\exists G\\subseteq P\\;\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1346,"backlinks":[{"id":"868b7b94868646b5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3900","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-lem-generic-exists-countable.md|58-lem-generic-exists-countable]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["66d43bb76d055059","d3f859dbdd37f018","85bf4cca0e5f1662","746b177ad471e105"]}